  "description": "Please Note: This kit comes with the 0.4ohm pod pre-installed we recommend using high VG e-liquid with this pod as it is not compatible with Nic Salt or 50/50 e-liquid. If you are an MTL vaper please change the pre-installed 0.4ohm pod to the 0.9ohm and use Nic Salt or 50/50 e-liquid . The Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro Vape Kit is the latest addition to Uwell’s renowned Caliburn series, designed to take your vaping experience to the next level with cutting-edge features and a sleek, portable design. Powered by a 1000mAh built-in battery, the G3 Pro offers adjustable wattage up to 35W, catering to both MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping styles. The device features a user-friendly full-length OLED screen that displays essential information such as wattage, coil resistance, and battery life. This kit includes two 2ml top-fill Caliburn G3 pods with built-in coils and Uwell’s Pro-FOCS Flavour Technology. The 0.4ohm pod provides a smooth and flavourful RDL vape, while the 0.9ohm pod is ideal for those who prefer a tighter MTL draw and stronger flavour. The top-fill system ensures mess-free refills, and the pods are designed to be leak-resistant, making the G3 Pro perfect for on-the-go vaping. The G3 Pro also includes multiple safety features, including short-circuit protection and low voltage protection, ensuring a safe and reliable vaping experience. With its stylish design and robust performance, the Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro is an excellent choice for vapers of all levels. When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Browse our vape liquids online and enhance your vaping with this kit. Coil Details: We recommend using the following e-liquid with these pods Uwell Caliburn G3 0.4ohm - High VG E-Liquid Uwell Caliburn G3 0.9ohm - Nic Salt or 50/50 E-Liquid How to set up the Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro Pod Vape Kit",
